   "title": "Put z=x+iy",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&z-1=(x-1)+iy\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": []
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Use tanθ",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\tan\\left(-\\dfrac\\pi4\\right)=\\dfrac{y}{x-1}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ -1=\\dfrac{y}{x-1}\\\\[5pt]&y=-(x-1)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ x+y-1=0\\end{aligned}\\]",
