   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Which part of the line",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{The angle $-\\frac\\pi4$ is in the fourth}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{quadrant, so $x-1>0$ and $y<0$.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
